<title>HONG KONG: First Commercial sets US$150 mln FRCD.</title>
<headline>First Commercial sets US$150 mln FRCD.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating rate</p>
<p>certificate of deposit issue was announced by arranger WestLB.</p>
<p>BORROWER FIRST COMMERCIAL BANK</p>
<p> AMOUNT   US$150 MLN   COUPON    6ML+20BP    MATURITY  5 YRS</p>
<p> TYPE     FRCD	   ISS PRICE PAR	   LAUNCHED  30.AUG.96</p>
<p> PUTS     NONE	   CALLS     YR 3	  REPLIES  20.SEPT.96</p>
<p> LISTING  NONE	   REPAYMENT BULLET	DENOMS    US$500K</p>
<p> RATINGS  *		SALE LMTS STANDARD    TAX PROV  --</p>
<p> NEG PLG  YES	    CRS DEF   YES	   FORCE MAJ YES</p>
<p> HOME CTRY TAIWAN	GOV LAW   ENGLISH     PAY DATE  EARLY OCT</p>
<p> NOTES    THE ISSUER IS RATED A2 BY MOODY'S</p>
<p>MGT LEVELS AND FEES</p>
<p>	 SENIOR LEAD MANAGER: US$12-15 MLN  15  BP  ALL-IN 23BP</p>
<p>		  LEAD MANAGERS US$7-12  MLN  13.5BP  ALL-IN 22.7BP</p>
<p>			 MANAGERS US$2-7   MLN  10 BP   ALL-IN 22 BP</p>
<p>ARRANGERS WESTLB, CITICORP INTERNATIONAL, TOKYO MITSUBISHI, ANZ</p>
<p>	     INTERNATIONAL MERCHANT BANK, FIRST CHICAGO BANK, AND</p>
<p>	     SUMITOMO FINANCE</p>
<p>--HK Newsroom (852) 2847 4039</p>
</text>
